      "what": "{match} is not hourly on a fixed minute in :10\u2013:50",
      "fix": "use \"<minute> * * * *\" with a minute from 10 to 50 (bootstrap assigns it) \u2014 other crons collide with the :00 stampede or break the hourly scheduler run"
